      "message": "fix(2d): start a new, larger outline of a whole-model contour at Top Z\n\nA ring of a deeper band whose tool sweep reaches outside every sweep cut\nso far now gets every flat level under Top Z above its first level. Each\npass is then at most one stepdown under the pass before it. A ring that\ncannot be proven clear at the added levels refuses the operation by name.\nBefore, the first pass on such an outline buried the tool by the full\nheight above it (20 mm on the #2597 part) and posted with no warning.\n\nFixes #2597\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
